p += [section('What I like, what I would refine, what needs testing', '''<div class="three"><article class="card"><h3>Keep</h3><ul><li>Warm, restrained identity with clear card ownership.</li><li>Separate game and lesson modes.</li><li>Equal answer emphasis and optional chart access.</li><li>Factual progress and open topic choice.</li><li>Compact sound/haptic and appearance preferences.</li></ul></article><article class="card"><h3>Refine</h3><ul><li>The abrupt familiarity handoff.</li><li>Opening-specific visual tokens that drift from native.</li><li>Custom Previous/Skip press feedback.</li><li>Help naming and return-path predictability.</li><li>Feedback hierarchy and different meanings of correctness.</li></ul></article><article class="card"><h3>Test before deciding</h3><ul><li>Whether beginners can explain the first rule.</li><li>Whether chart access feels useful without overwhelming.</li><li>Thumb comfort and dock clearance on a mini.</li><li>Partial onboarding resume and experienced-user bypass.</li><li>EN/KO wording, large text, VoiceOver and physical haptics.</li></ul></article></div><p>Spacing and heading differences can be intentional. We should standardize their roles and test the result, rather than flatten the entire app into one arrangement or treat every local value as an error.</p>''')]

