p += [section('The next evidence we need', '''<ol><li><strong>Observed comprehension:</strong> ask adult beginners to explain why a hand wins, identify what the chart measures and distinguish a chart match from winning the game. Compare languages independently.</li><li><strong>Cross-mode predictability:</strong> after the opening, ask them to find help in a lesson and graded practice, dismiss it, resume, review a hand and change a setting without coaching.</li><li><strong>Physical mini-device comfort:</strong> compare 54/60 primary trials, answer reach and body scrolling. Observe slips and effort, not just which screenshot people prefer.</li><li><strong>Interrupted-session definitions:</strong> specify returning after one/two/five comparisons, optional placement, replay, lesson draft and mid-game exit. Preserve current progress and recovery bytes.</li><li><strong>Later native matrix:</strong> EN/KO × light/dark, normal/AX5, iOS 17/current iOS, VoiceOver, Reduce Motion/Transparency, Increased Contrast, long values and disabled states. Verify actual chart/model feedback and help returns.</li></ol><p>Keep the product offline. Manual usability observations can test these ideas without adding analytics, accounts or tracking. A retention experiment is a separate research question and does not follow automatically from this visual study.</p><details><summary>Source inventory and evidence boundaries</summary><p><code>Theme.swift</code> and <code>Components.swift</code> already define shared foundations. <code>LessonLearningUI.swift</code> handles paired normal text and accessibility reflow. <code>GradedTableLearningUI.swift</code> distinguishes chart and modeled EV. <code>RecordsView.swift</code> and <code>PracticeActivityView.swift</code> define factual progress; <code>SettingsView.swift</code> already provides compact native preferences. The linked research note includes line pointers.</p><p><a href="assets/before/manifest.json">Native before provenance</a> lists the source gallery, frame commit, kind and SHA-256. Historical screenshots are not proof of current device defects or interaction reachability. <a href="verification.json">HTML verification record</a> lists the new browser checks.</p><p>These proposals use sample values, a miniature illustrative chart and browser interactions. They do not compute poker grades, write saved progress, perform backups or change preferences on your phone. HTML scaling and motion cannot establish native Dynamic Type, edge-swipe, VoiceOver, spring or haptic behavior.</p></details>''','testing')]

p += ['<footer><strong>Exploration delivery</strong><p id="verification-summary">80 HTML proposal screenshots and 32 retained native screenshots. Final browser checks: 100 flow assertions across EN/KO × light/dark; matched normal line groups across 18 captured states; 44 large-text renders with one-scroll action reachability; 390/1440-pixel report filters, images, links and zero final console errors. These are browser checks, not native acceptance or beginner-learning evidence.</p><p>Owner steering: <a href="../../../.scratch/whole-app-consistency/feedback.md">WAC01–06</a>. Native and installed build 19 remain unchanged. The approved opening direction is preserved; this study refines its fit with the whole app.</p></footer></main><script>function update(){const l=document.querySelector("#lang").value,m=document.querySelector("#mode").value;document.body.classList.toggle("report-dark",m==="dark");document.querySelectorAll("img.before").forEach(i=>i.src="assets/before/"+l+"/"+m+"/"+i.dataset.scene+".png");document.querySelectorAll("img.after").forEach(i=>i.src="assets/after/"+l+"/"+m+"/"+i.dataset.scene+".png");document.querySelectorAll("a[href^=\"prototype.html\"]").forEach(a=>{const u=new URL(a.getAttribute("href"),location.href);u.searchParams.set("lang",l);u.searchParams.set("mode",m);a.href=u.pathname.split("/").pop()+u.search})}document.querySelectorAll("select").forEach(s=>s.addEventListener("change",update));document.querySelectorAll(".shot").forEach(i=>i.addEventListener("click",()=>window.open(i.src,"_blank")));update();</script></body></html>']
